{"seq":1,"slug":"lockstep-deterministic","title":"锁步与确定性模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/lockstep-deterministic","wordCount":1266,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"锁步与确定性模拟\">锁步与确定性模拟</h1><p>一场《星际争霸》对局里可能有上千个单位同时移动、战斗、寻路。如果每帧把每个单位的位置都发给对手，带宽根本扛不住。锁步给出的解法堪称优雅：什么状态都不发，只发玩家的鼠标点击和指令；两台机器跑一模一样的模拟，从相同输入推出相同结果。这是 RTS 数十年的同步基石，也是理解&quot;确定性&quot;这一概念最纯粹的入口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-相同输入-相同世界\">核心概念：相同输入，相同世界</h2><p>锁步的全部魔力建立在一个等式上：如果两台机器从相同初始状态出发，每个 tick 喂入完全相同的输入集合，且模拟函数完全确定，那么它们任意时刻的世界状态必然逐位相同。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mn>0</mn><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>B</mi></msubsup><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> simulate 确定</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^{A}_{t} = S^{B}_{t} \\iff S^{A}_0 = S^{B}_0 \\ \\wedge\\ \\forall k \\le t:\\ I^{A}_k = I^{B}_k \\ \\wedge\\ \\text{simulate 确定}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1383em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8913em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">simulate </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">确定</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因此网络上只需传输每个玩家每 tick 的输入指令——而输入量与玩家数相关，与场上单位数无关。这是锁步在带宽上碾压状态同步的根本原因，与 <a href=\"../foundations/latency-bandwidth\">延迟、带宽与抖动</a> 中&quot;仅输入&quot;那一行对应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[玩家A输入] --&gt; C[输入交换层&lt;br/&gt;广播本 tick 全体输入]&#10;  B[玩家B输入] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[机器A: simulate]&#10;  C --&gt; E[机器B: simulate]&#10;  D --&gt; F[S_A 与 S_B 逐位相同]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G{状态哈希一致?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[检测到 desync]\">flowchart TD\n  A[玩家A输入] --&gt; C[输入交换层&lt;br/&gt;广播本 tick 全体输入]\n  B[玩家B输入] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[机器A: simulate]\n  C --&gt; E[机器B: simulate]\n  D --&gt; F[S_A 与 S_B 逐位相同]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G{状态哈希一致?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[检测到 desync]</pre><h2 id=\"输入延迟与-等齐-难题\">输入延迟与&quot;等齐&quot;难题</h2><p>锁步有个绕不开的硬约束：一个 tick 的模拟必须等到<strong>所有</strong>玩家该 tick 的输入都到齐才能推进。任何一个玩家的输入晚到，全场都得停下等他——这就是为什么早期 RTS 一旦有人网络抖动，所有人都会卡顿。</p>\n<p>经典的缓解办法是<strong>输入延迟</strong>（input delay）：玩家在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> tick 按下的键，约定在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t+d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> tick 才生效。这给了输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个 tick 的时间跨网络到达。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 通常取 2–4 帧，刚好覆盖一个 RTT：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≳</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mtext>RTT</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>tick</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\gtrsim \\lceil \\text{RTT} / \\Delta_{\\text{tick}} \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9592em;vertical-align:-0.2296em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel amsrm\">≳</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTT</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tick</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代价是本地操作有了固定的输入延迟手感——你的点击要等几帧才动。这是锁步在三角权衡里付出的延迟代价。彻底消除这种延迟、又不放弃确定性的方案，正是把锁步与预测结合的回滚，详见 <a href=\"../techniques/rollback-netcode\">回滚网络同步</a>。这与状态同步阵营靠 <a href=\"client-prediction\">客户端预测与协调</a> 解决延迟形成有趣对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确定性-最难的工程纪律\">确定性：最难的工程纪律</h2><p>&quot;相同输入产生相同结果&quot;听起来理所当然，实际上是整个方案最脆弱、最难维护的部分。任何在两台机器上行为不一致的细节，都会让世界悄悄分叉。常见的确定性杀手包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杀手</th>\n<th>为何不确定</th>\n<th>对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>浮点运算</td>\n<td>不同 CPU/编译器舍入可能不同</td>\n<td>用定点数（fixed-point）算关键逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器遍历顺序</td>\n<td>哈希表迭代顺序因实现而异</td>\n<td>用有序容器或显式排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机数</td>\n<td>各端种子或调用次数不同</td>\n<td>同步种子、同序消费 RNG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未初始化内存</td>\n<td>读到的脏值各端不同</td>\n<td>严格初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多线程时序</td>\n<td>线程交错不可复现</td>\n<td>模拟逻辑单线程化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中浮点是最臭名昭著的。即使同一份代码，x86 与 ARM、不同优化等级都可能在最后一位产生差异，而这点差异经过成千上万 tick 会被放大成肉眼可见的分叉。因此严肃的锁步项目往往把全部gameplay 逻辑改用<strong>定点数</strong>实现，把渲染等非确定性部分严格隔离在模拟之外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"desync-检测与回放\">desync 检测与回放</h2><p>既然确定性难以百分百保证，工程上必须能<strong>检测</strong>分叉。标准做法是每隔若干 tick 计算一次世界状态的校验哈希（checksum），各端交换比对。一旦哈希不一致，就说明已经 desync，此时通常只能弹出错误并中断对局——因为锁步没有&quot;权威真相&quot;可供纠正，所有副本地位平等。</p>\n<p>确定性还带来一个几乎免费的副产品：<strong>回放</strong>。既然世界完全由初始状态加输入序列决定，那么只要存下这串输入，就能精确重演整局——这正是 RTS 录像文件极小却能完整复现对局的原因。这一性质也被反作弊用于事后审计，见 <a href=\"../infrastructure/security-anticheat\">安全与反作弊</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每 N tick 计算 checksum] --&gt; B[与对端交换]&#10;  B --&gt; C{一致?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[继续推进]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[判定 desync&lt;br/&gt;中断或求助调试]&#10;  D --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[每 N tick 计算 checksum] --&gt; B[与对端交换]\n  B --&gt; C{一致?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[继续推进]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[判定 desync&lt;br/&gt;中断或求助调试]\n  D --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>锁步只传输入、不传状态，靠&quot;相同输入+确定性模拟&quot;保证各端世界逐位一致。</li>\n<li>带宽与场上单位数无关、只与玩家数相关，是 RTS 选它的核心理由。</li>\n<li>必须等所有玩家输入到齐才能推进；用输入延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 覆盖一个 RTT，代价是固定操作延迟。</li>\n<li>确定性是最难的工程纪律：浮点、容器顺序、RNG、多线程都是分叉源，常需改用定点数。</li>\n<li>无权威真相，故只能用 checksum 检测 desync 并中断；确定性附带极小回放与事后审计能力。</li>\n<li>把锁步与预测结合以消除输入延迟的方案是 <a href=\"../techniques/rollback-netcode\">回滚网络同步</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"锁步与确定性模拟","id":"锁步与确定性模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：相同输入，相同世界","id":"核心概念-相同输入-相同世界"},{"level":2,"text":"输入延迟与\"等齐\"难题","id":"输入延迟与-等齐-难题"},{"level":2,"text":"确定性：最难的工程纪律","id":"确定性-最难的工程纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"desync 检测与回放","id":"desync-检测与回放"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"延迟、带宽与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/foundations/latency-bandwidth"},"next":{"title":"状态同步与快照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/multiplayer-netcode/sync-models/state-snapshot"}}